import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 943 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 9 | Lift Myriad Ranks Up Together to Evolve","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 943 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 9 | Lift Myriad Ranks Up Together to Evolve","no":943,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 9","Collective Ascension","Lead-the-Group Evolution","Feedback"],"related":["25-Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism","904-Collective-Ascension Obligation","942-Strong Ones Do Not Ascend Alone"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0943_模块5-规则九-抬着万族一起进化.md","filePath":"en/0943_模块5-规则九-抬着万族一起进化.md"}'),a={name:"en/0943_模块5-规则九-抬着万族一起进化.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,h,c){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-943-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-9-lift-myriad-ranks-up-together-to-evolve" tabindex="-1">Entry 943 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 9 | Lift Myriad Ranks Up Together to Evolve <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-943-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-9-lift-myriad-ranks-up-together-to-evolve" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 943 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 9 | Lift Myriad Ranks Up Together to Evolve&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Document 25 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-being-strong-means-being-strong-enough-to-make-others-strong-too" tabindex="-1">Introduction: being strong means being strong enough to make others strong too <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-being-strong-means-being-strong-enough-to-make-others-strong-too" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: being strong means being strong enough to make others strong too&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Rule 8 forbids &quot;ascending alone&quot;; Rule 9 further gives a positive path — the strong one not only may not leave, but must actively walk in front, reach back, and lift Myriad Ranks up together to evolve. This is not a moral call, but a Heavenly-Dao-layer mandatory assignment: the higher your power level, the heavier the &quot;lifting task&quot; assigned; if you do not lift, the power itself is recovered in the causal loop. Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules are harder than the old cosmos&#39;s &quot;strong-one self-discipline&quot; precisely in that they write &quot;taking disciples, supporting the weak, advancing civilization&quot; from virtue into obligation.</p><p>The six top-level axioms run through it: the collective-ascension axiom is this rule&#39;s direct source; the republican axiom of Myriad Races defines &quot;the lifted object&quot; as all Myriad Ranks, not some sect or faction; the anti-predation axiom negates the Matthew cycle of &quot;stronger the strong, weaker the weak&quot;; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the lifting act itself carry no manipulation; the law-first axiom lets lifting tasks&#39; measurement, assessment, and exemption be stipulated first by law.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-the-three-part-lifting-task" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: The Three-Part Lifting Task <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-the-three-part-lifting-task" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: The Three-Part Lifting Task&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Dao-text feedback</strong>: every major breakthrough, he must organize that realm&#39;s insights and pitfall records into an open Dao text, uploaded to the Alaya public library (connecting Rule 4);</li><li><strong>Discipleship quota</strong>: the strong one must, by power level, take a certain number of juniors under his wing, especially prioritizing Youth Supremes, weak clans, plant spirits, and other starting-difficult groups;</li><li><strong>Civilizational engineering</strong>: periodically participate in his plane&#39;s increment-development, infrastructure, and ecological-restoration projects, with contribution counted toward the plane-sovereign strong-one four-dimensional assessment&#39;s &quot;responsibility 15.&quot;</li></ol><p>The lifting task is not charity, but directly linked to the strong one&#39;s own breakthrough and law-anchor-permission renewal.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Feedback-cycle argument</strong>: the Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism (Document 25) proves the energy flow the strong one feeds back to Myriad Ranks, amplified by the Myriad-Rank-origin bidirectional cycle and returned to the strong one, far exceeds what he gains by direct predation — lifting others is lifting oneself;</li><li><strong>System-resilience argument</strong>: a civilization with only a few strong ones collapses at disaster; whole-system Myriad-Ranks lifting is civilization&#39;s fundamental risk resistance;</li><li><strong>Anti-Matthew argument</strong>: the old cosmos&#39;s &quot;strong stay strong&quot; Matthew effect is precisely the source of class solidification; Rule 9 reverses the Matthew cycle into &quot;strong ones grow stronger through lifting others, juniors grow stronger through being lifted and catch up.&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network generates a &quot;lifting task work order&quot; for each strong one, dispatched by realm level, with progress real-time public;</li><li>Discipleship quality is double-scored by disciples&#39; growth records and juniors&#39; comments, eliminating &quot;name-only master-disciple&quot;;</li><li>Lifting-task completion directly affects law-anchor-permission renewal and the plane-sovereign strong-one four-dimensional assessment score;</li><li>Strong ones genuinely stuck in cultivation bottlenecks and temporarily unable to lift are allowed Quest-Sediment-Domain-study-style task exemptions, but must make it up after returning.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: work-order progress lags, network reminder and public notice;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: name-only discipleship, forged feedback records, law-anchor permissions frozen, recorded in Alaya&#39;s integrity archive;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: under the name of &quot;lifting&quot; actually controlling — turning the lifted into private dependent forces, handled heavily under Rule 5 (no private hoarding no monopoly) and Rule 19 (eradicate class solidification).</li></ul><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s work-order system is the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee spot-checks master-disciple authenticity as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates &quot;using lifting to control&quot; cases as the third layer; the juniors being mentored and the Youth-Supreme supervision corps exercise reverse-commentary on the strong one&#39;s lifting-duty performance as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: a strong one&#39;s experience, if not fed back, goes to zero with his death; lifting makes experience compound</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: reversing the &quot;strong ones sucking the weak&quot; Matthew cycle into the symbiotic cycle of &quot;strong ones lifting the weak&quot;; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type strong ones treat followers as private soldiers and monopolize the halo; Heng Yuan Zhou strong ones who do not take disciples cannot even renew permissions</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: discipleship quotas are preferentially dispatched to weak clans&#39;, Youth Supremes&#39;, plant spirits&#39;, and planet consciousnesses&#39; juniors</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cross-plane strong ones may take on newly incorporated civilizations&#39; discipleship projects, extending the lifting radius to all of Heng Yuan Zhou</li></ul><p>The Myriad-Ranks-lifting work order has one easily overlooked layer of meaning: it rewrites the strong-one-and-junior relationship from &quot;gift&quot; into &quot;contract.&quot; In the old cosmos, a strong one taking a disciple was alms, grace, a favor that could be withdrawn anytime; Heavenly-Dao Rule 9 writes discipleship as a hard condition of the strong one&#39;s own breakthrough and permission renewal, so the disciple is no longer the strong one&#39;s appendage, but the strong one&#39;s partner in completing his own causality. This relationship reversal lets juniors owe no abject gratitude and need not grovel; the strong one also need not repeatedly flaunt &quot;how many I have taken&quot; as moral capital. Lifting becomes a two-way rush, not top-down alms.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Lift Myriad Ranks up together to evolve&quot; is not emotionalism, but a Heavenly-Dao-layer work order. Rule 9 makes the strong one&#39;s every growth simultaneously a growth for Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/904_模块5-第三条-集体升维义务.html">Entry 904 · Collective-Ascension Obligation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/942_模块5-规则八-强者不独自飞升.html">Entry 942 · Rule 8 Strong Ones Do Not Ascend Alone</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/965_模块5-规则三十一-万族本源双向循环.html">Entry 965 · Rule 31 Myriad-Rank-Origin Bidirectional Cycle</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
